The method AddAzureTableTransactionalStateStorage is an extension method on IServiceCollection but is marked internal, so it is not accessible from the test project directly. To test the call to GetRequiredService, I will create a small internal test class in the same namespace that calls this internal method, then test that class. This will allow me to indirectly test the internal extension method.

I will submit a test file that defines a test helper class in the Orleans.Hosting namespace and tests the internal extension method indirectly.

<tool>submit_test(csharp)</tool>
